# --- Line endings -------------------------------------------
# Windows ends each line with two hidden characters (CRLF). Mac/Linux use one (LF). If teammates use different ones,
# Git thinks every line changed, which causes messy diffs and fake merge conflicts. These lines make everyone consistent.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.js           text eol=lf
*.json         text eol=lf
*.html         text eol=lf
*.css          text eol=lf
*.md           text eol=lf
.gitignore     text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
